# Multi-agent parallel orchestration

Before launching **2+ parallel Cursor agents** on this repo, read **`docs/MULTI_AGENT_PARALLEL_ORCHESTRATION.md`**.

## Mandatory

1. **Worktree + branch** — `feature/agent-<task-slug>` via `scripts/pns_agent_worktree_bootstrap.ps1 -Create`; never parallel-write the same clone on `main`.
2. **Asymmetric scoping** — no overlapping file paths between concurrent agents; serialize if two tasks need the same file.
3. **Shared schema lock** — one sequential agent merges contract changes (`gradle/libs.versions.toml`, fleet matrix/catalog schema, DNG/session locks, version/changelog ship files, ADRs) **before** parallel feature agents start.

## USB

Never run `pns_capture_pipeline_verify` and `pns_chrome_ux_gate` **in parallel** on one ADB serial.

## Local gates per worktree

- **Tier 0:** `pns_local_dev_parallel.ps1`
- **Before merge:** `pns_verify_toolchain.ps1 -RunTests` on integration branch

See **`docs/LOCAL_FIRST_DEV_LOOP.md`**.
